Description: Provides a comprehensive set of tools for estimating livestock
    greenhouse gas emissions, feed-related land use footprints, and animal
    production based on IPCC Tier 2 methodologies and nutritional guidelines.
    The package processes census, herd demography, and diet data for ruminants
    (cattle, sheep, goats) and monogastrics (swine, poultry), calculating
    gross energy, dry matter intake, volatile solids, enteric and manure methane,
    direct and indirect nitrous oxide emissions, feed land use, and protein
    feed conversion ratios.
URL: https://juancbm99.github.io/herdr
